      en: ["Total area: Over 10,000 hectares", "Elevation: 1,000 to 1,300 meters above sea level", "Location: Bench Maji Zone, Southwestern Ethiopia", "Distinction: One of Ethiopia's largest state/privately owned estates", "Associated crops: Production of black pepper and ginger", "Climate: Tropical rainforest environment"],
